<title>ISRAEL: Weak earthquake in northern Israel -radio.</title>
<headline>Weak earthquake in northern Israel -radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Radio said at 2200 GMT on Sunday that an earthquake registering 3.6 on the Richter scale was felt in the city of Haifa and the Galilee region in the north of the Israel.</p>
<p>There were no reports of damage or injuries from the weak tremor.</p>
